---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-6">
            About the Paddle
        </h1>
        <div class="prose prose-lg prose-zinc">
            <p>
                Welcome to Canoe Blog. This site serves as a digital logbook for
                my canoe camping adventures. Born from a love of the Canadian
                Shield, silent lakes, and the smell of pine needles in the sun.
            </p>
            <p>
                Here you'll find trip reports, maps, and photography from
                Algonquin Park and beyond. Whether you're planning your own
                route or just dreaming of the water from your desk, I hope these
                stories inspire you.
            </p>
            <p class="font-serif italic text-sage-700 mt-8">
                "There is nothing - absolutely nothing - half so much worth
                doing as simply messing about in boats."
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</BaseLayout>
